-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-4.0-88"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-     INDEX { ebnSearchLuName,
-             ebnSearchIndex }
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-4.0-89"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-     ::= { ebnSearchTable 1 }
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-4.0-90">EbnSearchEntry ::= SEQUENCE {
-        ebnSearchLuName  SnaNAUWildcardName,
-        ebnSearchIndex   Unsigned32,
-        ebnSearchCpName  DisplayString,
