-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-4.0-93">ebnSearchIndex OBJECT-TYPE
-     SYNTAX Unsigned32
-     MAX-ACCESS not-accessible
-     STATUS current
-     DESCRIPTION
-         &quot;Secondary index enumerating the CONFIGURED order in which
