-            cross-subnet search,
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-4.0-99"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-            '*EBNS' indicates all native EBNs.
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-4.0-100"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-         Because the characters allowed in a CP name come from a
-         restricted character set, and because the three formats
-         listed here use no special characters, this object is not
-         subject to internationalization."
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-4.0-101"><artwork name="" type="" align="left" alt=""><![CDATA[
-     ::= { ebnSearchEntry 3 }
-]]></artwork>
-</t>
